WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.950
The four-button target-knockdown prerequisite leaves two bombs beside Ryu.

2
00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:02.150
Kimberly catches the waking Ryu with the normal throw.

3
00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:03.150
The existing bombs launch Ryu during the throw follow-through.

4
00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:03.750
Kimberly delays the heavy-punch teleport to match the bomb juggle.

5
00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:04.150
Crouching heavy punch extends the launch.

6
00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:04.550
Another heavy-punch teleport repositions for the medium pickup.

7
00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:05.350
Standing medium punch continues into Sprint launcher.

8
00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:06.150
Sprint launcher extends the juggle.

9
00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:06.900
Heavy bomb plant spends the last spray can.
